      "v": 9,
      "zh": "万军之耶和华如此说：「当建造万军之耶和华的殿，立根基之日的先知所说的话，现在你们听见，应当手里强壮。",
      "en": "“The Lord of Heaven’s Armies also says, ‘Gather strength, you who are listening to these words today from the mouths of the prophets who were there at the founding of the house of the Lord of Heaven’s Armies,[NOTE:1] so that the temple might be built.",
      "notes": [
        "These prophets who were there at the founding of the house of the Lord of Heaven’s Armies included at least Haggai and Zechariah, and perhaps others. The founding referred to here is not the initial laying of the temple’s foundations in 536 b.c. (Ezra 3:8) but the resumption of work two years before the time of the present narrative (i.e., in 520 b.c.), as vv. 10-12 make clear."
